Comment:
 The optional helper packages link system libraries dynamically and bundle
 none of them: vaulthalla-preview-cad uses Open CASCADE (LGPL-2.1 with
 exception) and libseccomp (LGPL-2.1); vaulthalla-preview-media uses
 FFmpeg's libraries as built by the distribution (Ubuntu's libavcodec is
 GPL-2+ because it enables x264/x265) and libseccomp. GPL-2+ is compatible
 with the AGPL-3.0+ helpers that link it.

